WEBVTT

00:04:59.298 --> 00:05:02.122
law enforcement, NGOs and companies --

00:05:02.146 --> 00:05:05.655
with the tools they need
to ultimately eliminate

00:05:05.679 --> 00:05:08.172
child sexual abuse material
from the internet.

00:05:09.571 --> 00:05:10.842
Let's talk for a minute --

00:05:10.866 --> 00:05:12.385
(Applause)

00:05:12.409 --> 00:05:13.713
Thank you.

00:05:13.737 --> 00:05:16.077
(Applause)

00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:20.317
Let's talk for a minute
about what those dots are.

00:05:21.323 --> 00:05:24.534
As you can imagine,
this content is horrific.

00:05:24.558 --> 00:05:28.406
If you don't have to look at it,
you don't want to look at it.

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:33.399
And so, most companies
or law enforcement agencies